1
00:00:00,700 --> 00:00:02,775
Guess who says baa?

2
00:00:03,075 --> 00:00:04,727
Baa! Baa!

3
00:00:05,127 --> 00:00:06,453
Can you guess?

4
00:00:06,453 --> 00:00:07,702
Who says baa?

5
00:00:10,202 --> 00:00:11,412
Here is a clue.

6
00:00:11,412 --> 00:00:12,689
Soft white wool,

7
00:00:12,689 --> 00:00:14,302
and floppy pink ears!

8
00:00:16,902 --> 00:00:18,877
It's Lulu Lamb!

9
00:00:19,277 --> 00:00:20,609
Baa! Hello, Honey!

10
00:00:20,609 --> 00:00:21,687
Lambs say baa,

11
00:00:21,687 --> 00:00:23,272
and we love to bounce!

12
00:00:24,022 --> 00:00:26,972
Lulu Lamb says baa, baa, baa.

13
00:00:27,372 --> 00:00:29,886
Bounce up high, then la, la,

14
00:00:29,886 --> 00:00:30,372
la!

15
00:00:30,972 --> 00:00:32,759
Can you say baa with me?

16
00:00:32,759 --> 00:00:34,812
Then bounce, bounce, bounce!

17
00:00:36,812 --> 00:00:38,030
Great baa-ing!

18
00:00:38,030 --> 00:00:40,611
Every friend has a special sound!

19
00:00:43,261 --> 00:00:45,068
Share with a friend and

20
00:00:45,068 --> 00:00:47,361
subscribe to Honey Bunny Kidz!

21
